  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supportive Monitoring of Rwanda Peacebuilding Prog</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppf&#xf6;ljning av Rwandas Fredsbyggande Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A supportive monitoring assignment, procured through the Framework    Agreement with Indevelop, as part of the Rwanda Peacebuilding         Programme. External consultants work together with IRDP to identify   qualitative indicators and monitor them during three missions:        January 2013, May 2013 and November 2013.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett st&#xf6;djande uppf&#xf6;ljningsuppdrag, upphandlat genom ramavtalet med    Indevelop, som en del av Rwandas fredsbyggande program. Externa       konsulter arbetar tillsammans med IRDP f&#xf6;r att identifiera            kvalitativa indikatorer samt f&#xf6;lja upp dem under tre uppdrag: jan     2013, maj 2013 och november 2013.</narrative>
  </description>
